Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,YIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU YAMU YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! YRO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,KINGOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,KINGOP! KINGOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,KINGOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,KINGOP! Va!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew a rookie like you couldn't keep\Nup with our Debtmaster Dueling System.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fast learner, and you haven't\Nwon your freedom from this place yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't threaten me, you little\Nwhippersnapper. You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.17,0:01:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it in\Nthe dueling business, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So just give up now and let\Nme take control of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally escape\Nfrom this virtual nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk a big game, but you have no\Nmonsters on the field to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving you wide open for an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Obnoxious Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life point now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You claim to be a\Nsuccessful man of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you've allowed your\Ncompetition to get the best of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I led you to\Ndo exactly what I wanted you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Ruklomba, the spirit king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you summon a monster\Nif my turn's not over? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruklomba is one of my more\Nprofitable investments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With this card in my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,every time I lose 1,000\Nor more life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I gain the ability to summon\Nanother one to the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthening my staff of workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So what was that you were saying about my\Nsuccess in business? Looks like I'm still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One step ahead of my competition, Yuki,\Nwith plenty of monsters left. It's not how
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,many monsters you have it's how skillfully\Nyou use them that counts I've been in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,business a long time and I've always had a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,large labor force that gave me the freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to fire whomever I wanted or there was\Nalways another employee who could pick up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:03:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the slack and that's how I do if one\Nmonster has to go I have another to take its
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,place that's just sad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I hired you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To do my dirty work,\NGansley. Now to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,on the other pools how does it feel to be\NI'll be all alone in my virtual universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,just waiting to lose your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Teya's met my Hitatsume Giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And these two think they can\Nactually escape. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop like you mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see the Kaiba brothers have\Nhad a little run-in with their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd never have\Nto see this place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Mokuba, this orphanage is\Njust a virtual illusion and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it still brings back bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did we get sent there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,After our parents disappeared, there\Nwas no one left to take care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So we got dumped off here until they\Ncould find another family to take us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll never forget the\Nday we first saw this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the worst day of my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, that's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow Noah was able to tap into\Nour memories and digitally replay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Events from our past. Very perceptive.\NNow enjoy the trip down memory lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now On our first\Nday here I sat in that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,swing all day But how\Ncould Noah have known that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was alone the entire time The only other
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,person who saw me there was Seto Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto was the only one\Nwho even cared about me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal. Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make the most of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Moki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a little walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that they were\Nhere with us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that they\Nleft us here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tears aren't going to help us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way you and I\Nare going to get through all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Emotions will only get in\Nthe way of our survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect anyone else\Nto help us ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are on our own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that was your idea of a pep talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning of my torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Moki. Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And in just five moves this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're, like, the best chess\Nplayer in the whole entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, almost. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Name one person who's\Nbetter at chess than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You, if you just concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,These visions must be painful to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Seto Kaiba never experienced virtual
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,software that interacts\Nwith a person's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what I need to\Ndestroy him once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this day\Nfor what feels like an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His empire will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep watching your past, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Moki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And he did it once again, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozaburu Kaiba has retained his\Ntitle as the world chess champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The corporate genius and\Nsix-time world champ is a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,master strategist who has\Nnever once lost a single match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He maintains his claim that there's\Nnot a person alive who can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake, this outspoken\Nbusiness tycoon has a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he is donating a portion of\Nhis winnings to a local orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he just made a\Nlot of children very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the day that\Nchanged my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I met my stepfather\Nfor the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Seto. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a cheap virtual projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, the children are this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be thrilled to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't want any of\Nthese brats touching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just take a few pictures of\Nthe papers and I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is money, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that stench?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You do bathe these little\Nurchins, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is our ticket out\Nof this dump, Mokey. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just here to visit,\Nnot to adopt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he takes us. What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me and do what I\Nsay, bro. Fine. Okay. Go, Zuboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to match wits with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And lose at your own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, kid, I'm in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a challenge for you,\Nand I know you never pass one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One game of chess, me against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win, you adopt my\Nbrother and me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one beats me at chess,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, and I've been playing it for\Nyears. I was a world champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,when you were sucking your\Nthumb You're in over your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,kid What makes you think you can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I never lose either\NSo what do you say? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you've certainly got a\Ngreat deal of confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,in yourself I have to give\Nyou credit with that But
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a busy man And\Nbabysitting for you isn't on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,my schedule So that means\Nyou're gonna back down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till the newspapers find out\Nyou're scared of a kid. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a reputation to uphold, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One match, one chance only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Set us up in a quiet room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, yes, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this game over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive for a 12-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What made you so sure you were going to\Nbeat Gozaburo at chess, Seto? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My desire to win that game was\Nfar greater than his, Mukuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,By challenging Gozaburo, I had nothing\Nto lose and everything to gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To him, it was just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take very long, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were my thoughts exactly, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need all the help you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pawn to E3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my opening move, kid. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've studied all your matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Studying's one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mastering's another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight to G5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've left your left flank exposed. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I had his strategies memorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop to B6. Checkmate. Ah! You lose. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have to adopt us\Nlike you promised, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the day I took\Ncontrol of my future. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was also the day\Nyou stopped calling me Moki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for me, we never\Nwould have escaped that rat hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned our lives around that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come back! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked the way it was before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At least back then, you\Nactually smiled once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fall\Nright into Noah's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using these illusions to\Nturn us against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The past is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost more than half\Nyour life points, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'll take over your body, leaving\Nyour mind trapped in this virtual abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get away with this, Gansley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Yo-E in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Yo-E's arrival forbids\Nyou from drawing a card next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,making him a valuable asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play the magic\Ncard, Premature Burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is invest a\Nmere 800 of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to revive\None of my former monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperium, return!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I've employed an\Nunlimited team of monsters, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My workforce already outnumbers\Nyours three monsters to two,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and my staff will continue to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you go ahead\Nand launch your attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With my three monsters on the\Nfront line, you'll never get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack with Chimera again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll just sacrifice\Ntwo of his monsters like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,he did last time to bring\Nout Reflector Holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing my own monster to\Nattack me instead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if I got rid of all his\Nmonsters and attacked him directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd do what he did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Obnoxious Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life point still!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can call forth Ruklomba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I lose 1,000\Nor more life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I gain the ability to summon\Nanother one to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finally realized\Nthat I'm unbeatable?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know that a\Ngood strategy takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stalling for time is a\Nsign of weakness, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pathetic. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's pathetic is the monster\Nyou've chosen as your deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That floating hairball does\Nnothing but spout gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Swing harder, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,wait what we're free dude Tristan\Nif you actually looked around
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd see that we're still trapped\NWe're a hundred feet in the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,air on some unknown virtual castle\Nin the middle of nowhere Well
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,at least I got us outside now\Nquit complaining and let's go find
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's gaining on her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bike can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, easy, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they install\Nthe brakes on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give that dive a perfect ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Duke, that was so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his yo-e monster, I\Ncan't draw a card this turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with a born strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how my business career began?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With one lemonade stand that\NI stole from my neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I turned that small\Nstand into the largest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,distributor of frozen lemonade\Nin the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes to show that even\Nwhen you start small,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,your investments can transform\Ninto an unstoppable force,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the ferocious\Nteam I've assembled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, enough stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I attack with my Celtic Guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll just activate his Reflector\NHold to bounce my attack back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to use his Reflector Hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gansley will have to sacrifice\Ntwo of his monsters first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,which will weaken his defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It may cost me some life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's a risk I'm going to have\Nto take if I want to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, obnoxious Celtic\NGuardian, attack his Yowie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're more\Nfoolish than I first thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.23,0:16:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll sacrifice Imperia and Yowie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to activate this,\NReflect your hold! Counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are falling faster\Nthan the stock market of 1929, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two direct hits. Three\Nstrikes and you're out. Then you can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,take a nap surprised by how real\Nthis duel feels it may be virtual but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes more of a toll on you than\Nthe duels you're used to doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it at least you're down to one monster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i think you'd better count again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You have two monsters left! How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were recovering from the\Ndirect attack to your life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I seized the opportunity\Nto strengthen my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it's best to get ahead\Nwhen your rival is down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so I sacrificed my Ruklamba,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to summon Wall of\NIllusion, plus another Ruklamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You had that move planned\Nall along, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now allow me to introduce\Nyou to my newest employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Wall of Illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are its strengths, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,any monster foolish enough\Nto attack it is removed from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the field immediately and sent\Nback to my opponent's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So you may want to resign now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my associate, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gansley, has almost won me\Nmy first victory of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Yugi will become a permanent\Nfixture in my virtual universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do now that he has two\Nmonsters on the field again? I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,attack because if i do he'll just\Nuse his deck master's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,to sacrifice them and activate\Nreflector hole causing my own monster
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack me instead of him and i\Ncan't afford to let that happen again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with only 500 life\Npoints left i'll lose the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,duel and my body to\Ngansley then i'll be stuck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,in this cyber world\Nforever while he escapes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,disguised as me well you\Ngave it your best shot my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,young friend but in the\Nend big business always
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,wins besides i've roamed\Nthis virtual void for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,too long now and you're\Nmy ticket out it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,over gansley so don't\Nmake your travel plans yet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.81,0:19:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,keep your falls home you'll be that much
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.89,0:19:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,more disappointed when\Nyou plunge into defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your pitiful Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That pathetic pom-pom is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you are doomed from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can taunt me all you want, Gansley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I trust my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I was insightful enough to assemble\Nan unstoppable arsenal of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters\Nat this point, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've rendered you so weak, you'll be\Nout of life points before my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing me to finally\Nreturn to civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,While your mind is virtually\Nscattered throughout cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
